# not from a tape — written for the app, so there is no v1 line to match.
@segment  announcement
@title    What This Session Is
@levels   F1
@verbosity 2
@duration ~45s
@from     F1

# Verbosity 2: adds what the destination is, and what the session will do to
# get there. See announcement.v1.gws for how the tokens work.

say This session is set to verbosity two. The climbs, and a description of each place you arrive.
pause 4
say We are going to [[destination]]. [[destinationLine]]
pause 5
say The way there passes through [[stations]].
pause 4
say Nothing is required of you along the way. Notice what is there, and let the rest be.
pause 6
